{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_269006E1","title":"Can Caleb help Palmer","entry":"Dlg_269006E1::entry","exit":"Dlg_269006E1::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_A4DDEA2A","articyId":"72057611218083296","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"Helm's alee, matey! Come to shoot the breeze?","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Helm's alee, matey! Come to shoot the breeze?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":400.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46737","byteOffset":32013208,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_851C87CA","articyId":"72057611218083310","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"Square-rigged and stowed away, that's how I keep the skeletons in my bilge.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Square-rigged and stowed away, that's how I keep the skeletons in my bilge.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1000.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30626","byteOffset":19466512,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_A26B3AC5","articyId":"72057611218083324","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"You mean an adventurer? A fugitive of fate? Who needs must ply the dark and dreamless depths in search of brighter shores?","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You mean an adventurer? A fugitive of fate? Who needs must ply the dark and dreamless depths in search of brighter shores?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35049","byteOffset":25620096,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_89678F63","articyId":"72057611218083350","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"Aye! So tell me, who is this mysterious stranger who needs a night time boat ride?","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Aye! So tell me, who is this mysterious stranger who needs a night time boat ride?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2200.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28313","byteOffset":18593392,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_2BC66AB2","articyId":"72057611218083364","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"Palmer…? Shake my timbers and call me turtle, you mean Palmer Vesh? The space pirate? What dangerous game are you playing here, mate?","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Palmer…? Shake my timbers and call me turtle, you mean Palmer Vesh? The space pirate? What dangerous game are you playing here, mate?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2800.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30396","byteOffset":19380216,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_4E2A7FB9","articyId":"72057611218083395","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"Aye, I’m sure she did. Like the sirens promised riches and handed out rocks.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Aye, I’m sure she did. Like the sirens promised riches and handed out rocks.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":4300.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42839","byteOffset":30537184,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_95EA3453","articyId":"72057611218083402","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"A PIRATE'S life. Worth risking your own planks for, and mine, do you think?","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A PIRATE'S life. Worth risking your own planks for, and mine, do you think?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3675.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24579","byteOffset":17174856,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_BAC93D8C","articyId":"72057611218083433","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"That be true enough. Us sailors are a crew, whether we like it or not. And you never leave a crew member behind. Not even a rotten one.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That be true enough. Us sailors are a crew, whether we like it or not. And you never leave a crew member behind. Not even a rotten one.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4900.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20857","byteOffset":15773344,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_3B7F4064","articyId":"72057611218083447","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"Aye, I’ll help. Tell Captain Vesh to come to the Docks at curfew. We’ll get out to the far beyond.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Aye, I’ll help. Tell Captain Vesh to come to the Docks at curfew. We’ll get out to the far beyond.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5500.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49075","byteOffset":32906336,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_2B39D369","articyId":"72057821671309559","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"Someone? Who is this mysterious stranger who needs a night time boat ride?","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Someone? Who is this mysterious stranger who needs a night time boat ride?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45146","byteOffset":31414160,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_4E65EC32","articyId":"72057611218083303","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Actually, I have to ask you something privately.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Actually, I have to ask you something privately.","TextSheVersion":"Actually, I have to ask you something privately.","TextTheyVersion":"Actually, I have to ask you something privately."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":700.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28608","byteOffset":18707576,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_CB9971E6","articyId":"72057611218083317","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Right. I have a friend who needs to escape the LUZ without being seen.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right. I have a friend who needs to escape the LUZ without being seen.","TextSheVersion":"Right. I have a friend who needs to escape the LUZ without being seen.","TextTheyVersion":"Right. I have a friend who needs to escape the LUZ without being seen."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"positi